OL,3,GNEWSAVillage votes to leave UK over
OL,4,Aasylum housing plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of an Oxfordshire village
OL,7,Fhave voted to become independent from
OL,8,Fthe UK in a symbolic referendum held in
OL,9,Fprotest at plans to house more than
OL,10,F1,000 migrants at a former military
OL,11,Fbase.
OL,13,FVillagers in Piddington, near Bicester,
OL,14,Fvoted on Tuesday over Home Office
OL,15,Fproposals to house up to 1,256 male
OL,16,Fasylum seekers at nearby MoD Bicester.
OL,18,FThe referendum was organised by the
OL,19,Fparish council and out of 312 votes
OL,20,Fcast, 285 voted to leave, 26 voted no,
OL,21,Fand one ballot paper was spoiled.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
